&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;多様な人材の活躍&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;社員一人ひとりの個性と人権を尊重し、多様な人材の登用を進める。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・外国人人材を含むトランスナショナル人材の採用・育成&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・キャリア採用の拡充と活躍支援&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・女性社員の活躍を支援するためのプログラムの実行&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・社員エンゲージメント向上による離職率低減&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;人材育成&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;多様な人材の活躍を支援するための育成体制の整備。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・専門人材育成のための職能別教育の拡充&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・トランスナショナル幹部社員育成教育の実施&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・社員のリスキリングとＤＸ人材の育成&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;安心・安全な労働環境&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:18pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;従業員のゆとりと豊かさを実現し、快適で安全な職場環境を確保する。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・労働コンプライアンス遵守のためのＰＤＣＡサイクルの展開&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・安全衛生活動の強化&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・健診受診率と再検査受診率の向上&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・ワークスタイルの柔軟化を実現させるための環境整備&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;④　指標と目標&lt;/p&gt;
