  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01805-000:DescriptionOfAmortizationOfGoodWillAndUnAmortizedGoodWillTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;【報告セグメントごとののれんの償却額及び未償却残高に関する情報】&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E01805-000:DescriptionOfAmortizationOfGoodWillAndUnAmortizedGoodWillTextBlock>
